      "message": "docs(site): CAM fundamentals section\n\nEight pages under site/content/guide/fundamentals/ (feeds and speeds, tool\nselection, toolpath strategy, rigidity, chips and coolant, surface finish,\nproving out, post and machine quirks) plus a section index, linked from the\nguide index. Each pairs the general machining principle with what CamCraft\ndoes, checked against upstream/main.\n\nFixes #1281\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
